This repository is TST Desk. Before your first action in any session, read ./AGENTS.md
in full and treat it as binding. It outranks your defaults.

Reference documents — read these ON DEMAND with the file tools, never all at once.
They currently sit at the repo root and move to docs/ during TD-103:
  tst-desk-spec.md     what we're building and why (behavior source of truth)
  tst-desk-backlog.md  epics, stories, acceptance criteria (scope source of truth)

Working on a story: search for that story's section by ID and read ONLY that section,
plus the specific spec sections it references. Do not read either file whole.

Never start a story whose dependencies are unfinished. Never build anything outside
the current milestone. If unsure whether something is in scope, stop and ask.
